{"name":"São Tomé and Príncipe","slug":"sao-tome-and-principe","code":"ST","continent":"Africa","hero":"plonkit/sao-tome-and-principe/banner1.webp","updated":"2026-05-31T20:48:29.504Z","sections":[{"title":"Identifying São Tomé & Príncipe","title_zh":"辨識聖多美普林西比","items":[{"id":"mteu","text":["All the coverage was taken with a low quality camera that’s commonly referred to as “Shitcam”. The car will often be completely blurred, with a **very large blur** covering the back and a [somewhat smaller blur](https://goo.gl/maps/YfaEf11wuzdt3NYv8) covering the front.","NOTE: The coverage is a newer variant of shitcam, where the image is dimmer and hazier than the original shitcam primarily found in [India](https://maps.app.goo.gl/3MYW94icKvwhWTc66) and [Nigeria](https://maps.app.goo.gl/eETqUgMHvyiCR4di8)."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/sao-tome-and-principe/st_shit.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/LTkTMgjD7rxFCcgE8","clues":["camera"],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"EmV2","text":["**Portuguese** is the main language used on São Tomé and Príncipe."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/sao-tome-and-principe/st_language.webp","link":"","clues":["language"],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"8u6S","text":["On top of the language, the Portuguese influence can also be seen in infrastructure, such as ladder poles and pedestrian signs with the same design as in Portugal."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/sao-tome-and-principe/st_polepedestriancrossing.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/4ojwFdj6pSKUkbeF8","clues":["utility_poles","language","signs"],"important":false,"tagged":true},{"id":"Iix7","text":["São Tomé and Príncipe are **tropical islands**, which are almost completely covered in rainforests. Banana plants are especially common throughout the islands."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/sao-tome-and-principe/st_tropical.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/qjvx6rFCZPN7M3QdA","clues":[],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"ij58","text":["In many locations, you will notice a **slanted antenna** protruding from the side of the car."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/sao-tome-and-principe/antenna.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/4VeKVBatyNNenp8y9","clues":[],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"0mhZ","text":["Some wooden poles are painted **blue **on the bottom. You can also read the letters **CST **on them."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/sao-tome-and-principe/st_bluepolepaint.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/6x7TkiEeH4v4XSGL7","clues":["utility_poles","language"],"important":false,"tagged":true},{"id":"1MAM","text":["Taxis and minibuses are painted in a **bright yellow** colour."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/sao-tome-and-principe/yellow_taxi_sao_tome.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/JkNYuG5P1kwrHWMa8","clues":[],"important":false,"tagged":false}]},{"title":"Region-specific clues","title_zh":"區域性專屬線索","items":[{"id":"oaFS","text":["This desaturated and even dimmer variant of shitcam is most common on Príncipe."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/sao-tome-and-principe/st_principecam.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/rMu2eGbM2tD2KF719","clues":["camera"],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"YviS","text":["The car used on Príncipe can be recognised by the **blue** roof and silver roof rails.","NOTE: Remember that it can sometimes be blurred out."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/sao-tome-and-principe/principe_car.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/gFGYZg3wL1LP4acT9","clues":["architecture"],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"5DnQ","text":["The car used on São Tomé is **black** with black roof rails. In most locations, it is blurred out."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/sao-tome-and-principe/sao_tome_car.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/XNmPyAVxnjhpm81n7","clues":["architecture"],"important":false,"tagged":false}]},{"title":"Spotlight","title_zh":"重點地標","items":[{"id":"1vUE","text":["You can find **oil palm plantations** in southern São Tomé."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/sao-tome-and-principe/st_oilpalmplantation.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/13XwZpCMeKqxn6wG7","clues":["nature"],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"5C59","text":["The town of Trinidade has poles with **red and white** pole paint."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/sao-tome-and-principe/st_trinidadpolepaint.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/1Aty7JQDMLYERf7N8","clues":["utility_poles"],"important":false,"tagged":true}]}],"tip_count":12,"facts":{"driving_side":"right","phone_numbers":"+239","domains":[".st"],"years":["2023","2024","2025"],"street_suffix":[{"language":"São Tomean Portuguese","forms":"Rua","word":"Street"}],"lines":[["white"],["white"],["white"]]},"gallery":{"companies":[{"image":"geohints/companies/companies_246.svg","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/tstoM4bJY536oEhE9"}],"gas_stations":[{"image":"geohints/companies/companies_1284.svg","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/wi9U3ao1Uzc3EqT66"}],"flags":[{"image":"geohints/flags/flags_257.svg","link":""}],"google_vehicles":[{"image":"geohints/googleVehicles/car_850.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/negVxQkhq86h6YeP6"},{"image":"geohints/googleVehicles/car_851.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/gE2jgfRKjYvUkgp8A"},{"image":"geohints/googleVehicles/car_852.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/dPNJE56ykrjzbaoXA"},{"image":"geohints/googleVehicles/car_902.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/Ejajb5Qy8zx7aCT46"},{"image":"geohints/googleVehicles/car_1065.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/ojB9HZViFnThNTvG6"}],"license_plates":[{"image":"geohints/licensePlates/sao_tome.webp","link":""}],"post_boxes":[{"image":"geohints/post_boxes/sao_tome_1.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/4YyBp57DL1QAs9828"}],"utility_poles":[{"image":"geohints/utilityPoles/pole_278.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/NYoGmfGUy6esDLVe7"},{"image":"geohints/utilityPoles/pole_279.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/rB2QePcUoLrF4qBo7"},{"image":"geohints/utilityPoles/pole_280.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/zDM289x87C41uVQB8"},{"image":"geohints/utilityPoles/pole_364.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/eqiCnavLMdKcEZYe9"},{"image":"geohints/utilityPoles/pole_365.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/C3oBPYGSNNUippJYA"}]},"key":"sao tome and principe"}